reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959825405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4960025695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121328#issuecomment-4960025695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121328","id":4960025695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6P8Xw","user":{"login":"richard-hajek","id":29554823,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTU0ODIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29554823?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek","html_url":"https://github.com/richard-hajek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T16:08:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T16:13:53Z","body":"I checked versions:\n- Godot 3: NOT AFFECTED\n- Godot 4.3: NOT AFFECTED\n- Godot 4.4: AFFECTED\n- Godot 4.6: AFFECTED\n\nI tested on brand new projects each time to make sure there is no cross contamination. I am right now unfortunately unable to check with more granularity, I am limited to what is in the nixpkgs repos because I can't get the specific version installation to work","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4960025695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4963740289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121328#issuecomment-4963740289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121328","id":4963740289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ9yqgQ","user":{"login":"sockeye-d","id":106356149,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlbdtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106356149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d","html_url":"https://github.com/sockeye-d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T23:18:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T23:18:08Z","body":"I'm pretty sure this is just an artifact of the combination of the way that KWin and Godot's fake embedded windows on X11/Xwayland interact — KWin doesn't like the window frame being programmatically placed outside of the frame of the display, so it attempts to clip it to the display frame, and Godot is trying to move the game window to the embedding window every frame, so you end up with this. Try enabling true Wayland support in the editor settings and it should start working fine","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4963740289/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4963824931","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121328#issuecomment-4963824931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121328","id":4963824931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ931Iw","user":{"login":"richard-hajek","id":29554823,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTU0ODIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29554823?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek","html_url":"https://github.com/richard-hajek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard-hajek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T23:29:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T23:29:21Z","body":"Oh you were right! In `Editor > Editor Settings... > (Toggle Advanced On) > Run > Platforms > Prefer Wayland` I set to true and it fixed it!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"htt